* {{I|Immaculate Heart}}/{{I|Saturnus}}: Normal tears orbit Isaac.
* {{I|Incubus|nr}}: The rings fired by the Incubus have a fixed size; charging the ring will only increase the size of the player's own rings.
** {{Dlc|r}} Works as expected.
