** {{Dlc|r}}{{I|Ipecac}} + {{I|Almond Milk}} / {{I|Soy Milk}}: Explosion damage maintained as tears vastly increases.
* {{I|A Lump of Coal|nr}}: Damage and size of the ring increases the further away it is from the player, but is actually roughly 2/3rds of tear damage up close. It takes a few tiles of distance to reach normal damage and go above it, with the maximum being 1.5x at roughly a room's width away.
** {{Dlc|r}} The damage is normal at point blank range but the damage increase per tile is significantly lower.
* {{I|Marked|r}}: The rings are now fired automatically with ring size depending on Isaac's distance from the cursor; the further he is, the larger the rings are.
* {{I|Mom's Eyeshadow}}: All rings become pink - testing is needed to find out if all rings have charm chance
* {{I|Proptosis}}: The ring's damage and size substantially increase, but decreases the further it travels.
** {{Dlc|r}} The ring's damage and size is based on the distance from Isaac. The damage is 4.38x when Isaac is on the center of the ring, down to 1.5x.
* {{T|Pulse Worm}}: The ring pulsates in size between 0.67x to 1.33x over a 2 second cycle.
* {{I|The Scooper}} / {{I|Stye|n}}: The effects have 20% chance to be applied per damage tick.
* {{I|Soy Milk|r}} : Fires automatically upon reaching full charge.
* {{I|Sulfuric Acid|r}}/{{I|Terra|n}}: The ring can destroy [[Obstacles]], but it can't open doors or {{r|Secret Room}}s. Terra also greatly increases knockback.
** {{dlc|r+}} The laser can now open doors.
* {{I|Tammy's Head}}: Tammy's head fires regular tears.

